@startuml 03-component
' Component diagram (DRAFT for pre-defense-1).
' Owners: A = Nuraly Abat (AI pipeline & evaluation), B = Sultan Muratbek (backend, data, DevOps), C = Kaisar Yessenov (frontend, UX, QA)
' Numbers 1-13 = module numbers in the report (section 10.1).
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F5F8FC
  BorderColor #1F3A5F
}

title Component Diagram (draft) — AI Test Case Generator

node "Browser" {
  [1 Web UI (Next.js)\nupload · progress · review ·\ntraceability · export  (C)] as UI
}

node "Application server (Docker Compose)" {
  [2 Reverse proxy (Caddy, TLS) (B)] as PROXY
  package "Backend API (FastAPI) — modular monolith" as API {
    [3 Auth & Users (B)] as AUTH
    [4 Documents & Parser (B)] as DOCS
    [5 Requirements &\nQuality gate (A + B)] as REQ
    [6 Generation API\n& Jobs (B)] as JOBS
    [9 Review &\nAudit log (C + B)] as REV
    [10 Export (CSV, XLSX,\nGherkin, JSON) (B)] as EXP
    [11 Admin &\nMetrics (B)] as ADM
  }
  package "Worker" as WK {
    [7 AI pipeline:\nretrieve → generate →\nvalidate → verify (A)] as PIPE
    [8 LLMProvider\ninterface (A)] as PROV
    [12 Evaluation\nharness (A)] as EVAL
  }
  database "13 PostgreSQL + pgvector (B)\nusers, documents, requirements,\njobs, test_cases, links, audit_log" as DB
}

node "GPU host (private network)" {
  [LLM server (Ollama / vLLM)\nOpenAI-compatible API] as LLM
  [Embedding model] as EMB
}

AUTH -[hidden]right- DOCS
DOCS -[hidden]right- REQ
REQ -[hidden]right- JOBS
AUTH -[hidden]down- REV
REV -[hidden]right- EXP
EXP -[hidden]right- ADM

UI --> PROXY : HTTPS (REST, SSE)
PROXY --> API : routes /api/v1/*
API --> DB : SQL (each module owns its tables)
JOBS ..> DB : enqueue job
PIPE --> DB : claim job (SKIP LOCKED),\nwrite results in one transaction
PIPE --> PROV
EVAL --> PROV
PROV --> LLM : HTTP /v1/chat/completions\n(JSON-schema output)
PIPE --> EMB : embeddings\n(dedupe, RAG)
@enduml
